flowchart TD
  A[Create Payment row] --> B[Unique idempotencyKey + providerRef]
  B --> C{Method}
  C -- Paystack --> D[initializePayment server secret]
  C -- Bank / OPay / UBA --> E[Show settlement accounts]
  D --> F[Customer pays hosted]
  E --> G[Customer pays offline + uploads proof]
  F --> H[Webhook or verify API]
  G --> I[Admin confirmBankTransfer]
  H --> J{HMAC / amount / currency / order match?}
  I --> J
  J -- No --> K[FAILED or investigation OPEN]
  J -- Yes --> L[finalizeOrderPaid idempotent]
  L --> M[Payment SUCCEEDED Order PAID]
  M --> N[PaymentWebhookEvent unique provider+eventId]
